sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as User Interface
    participant Core as GrblCore
    participant Com as ComWrapper
    participant Device as GRBL Device
    
    UI->>Core: SendCommand(gcode)
    Core->>Com: Write(command)
    Com->>Device: Send G-code
    Device-->>Com: Status Response
    Com-->>Core: ProcessMessage
    Core-->>UI: Update Status